hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16812","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Surayj ibn Yunus narrated to me, he said: Marwan ibn Mu'awiya narrated to us from Yahya ibn Kathir al-Kahili from Miswar ibn Yazid al-Asadi, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) prayed and omitted a verse, and a man said to him: O Messenger of Allah, you omitted such-and-such a verse. He said: Why did you not remind me of it?"
